   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Caption Scramble\n\nEach word arrives as random glyphs at the moment it is spoken and decodes left to right into the real letters.\n\nCategory: captions. Length: 9.3 s. WebGL: no.\n\nUse when:\n- The video is about software, security, AI or data and the captions should feel like a terminal decoding the voice as it speaks.\n- You want each word to land with a little texture but the phrase to settle into plain, readable type a moment later.\n\nAvoid when:\n- The tone is calm or editorial and glyph noise would read as a glitch: use caption-rise or caption-blur-in.\n- You want characters to appear one by one in order rather than decode from noise: use caption-typewriter.\n\nVariables:\n- captions (string): Captions, default \"[{\\\"text\\\":\\\" So\\\",\\\"startMs\\\":300,\\\"endMs\\\":460},{\\\"text\\\":\\\" here's\\\",\\\"startMs\\\":460,\\\"endMs\\\":700},{\\\"text\\\":\\\" the\\\",\\\"startMs\\\":700,\\\"endMs\\\":820},{\\\"text\\\":\\\" thing.\\\",\\\"startMs\\\":820,\\\"endMs\\\":1240},{\\\"text\\\":\\\" Most\\\",\\\"startMs\\\":1700,\\\"endMs\\\":1960},{\\\"text\\\":\\\" demo\\\",\\\"startMs\\\":1960,\\\"endMs\\\":2240},{\\\"text\\\":\\\" videos\\\",\\\"startMs\\\":2240,\\\"endMs\\\":2680},{\\\"text\\\":\\\" lose\\\",\\\"startMs\\\":2680,\\\"endMs\\\":2960},{\\\"text\\\":\\\" people\\\",\\\"startMs\\\":2960,\\\"endMs\\\":3320},{\\\"text\\\":\\\" in\\\",\\\"startMs\\\":3320,\\\"endMs\\\":3420},{\\\"text\\\":\\\" the\\\",\\\"startMs\\\":3420,\\\"endMs\\\":3520},{\\\"text\\\":\\\" first\\\",\\\"startMs\\\":3520,\\\"endMs\\\":3820},{\\\"text\\\":\\\" three\\\",\\\"startMs\\\":3820,\\\"endMs\\\":4100},{\\\"text\\\":\\\" seconds.\\\",\\\"startMs\\\":4100,\\\"endMs\\\":4780},{\\\"text\\\":\\\" Captions\\\",\\\"startMs\\\":5400,\\\"endMs\\\":5920},{\\\"text\\\":\\\" keep\\\",\\\"startMs\\\":5920,\\\"endMs\\\":6140},{\\\"text\\\":\\\" them\\\",\\\"startMs\\\":6140,\\\"endMs\\\":6300},{\\\"text\\\":\\\" watching,\\\",\\\"startMs\\\":6300,\\\"endMs\\\":6860},{\\\"text\\\":\\\" even\\\",\\\"startMs\\\":6960,\\\"endMs\\\":7180},{\\\"text\\\":\\\" with\\\",\\\"startMs\\\":7180,\\\"endMs\\\":7320},{\\\"text\\\":\\\" the\\\",\\\"startMs\\\":7320,\\\"endMs\\\":7420},{\\\"text\\\":\\\" sound\\\",\\\"startMs\\\":7420,\\\"endMs\\\":7760},{\\\"text\\\":\\\" off.\\\",\\\"startMs\\\":7760,\\\"endMs\\\":8300}]\"\n- font_size (number, 24-140): Font size, default 64\n- font_weight (number, 400-900): Font weight, default 800\n- color (color): Text color, default \"#ffffff\"\n- combine_tokens_within_milliseconds (number, 0-3000): Page window, default 1200\n- hold_ms (number, 0-2000): Hold, default 600\n- shadow (boolean): Shadow, default true\n- glyph_color (color): Glyph color, default \"#a3a3a3\"\n\nSource: https://github.com/Remocn/remocn. Licence: MIT. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
